          </div>
          <h3>Business-First Approach</h3>
          <p>We analyze your business workflows first, designing ERP logic that increases profit margins and reduces operational overhead.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <div class="hdev-bento-card">
          <div class="hdev-bento-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Clean, Maintainable Code</h3>
          <p>Following PEP-8 and strict Odoo architectural guidelines ensuring your custom code remains upgrade-safe for future versions.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 4 -->
        <div class="hdev-bento-card">
          <div class="hdev-bento-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Fast 48-Hour Onboarding</h3>
          <p>Skip months of recruitment. Review vetted developer profiles and kick off development within 48 business hours.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 5 -->
        <div class="hdev-bento-card bento-large">
          <div class="hdev-bento-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Flexible Engagement Models</h3>
          <p>Scale effortlessly between hourly tasks, part-time assistance, dedicated developers, or a full turnkey engineering squad.</p>
          <div class="hdev-bento-chip">Hourly • Part-Time • Full-Time</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════
       4. WHAT CAN OUR DEVELOPERS DO?
  ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="hdev-sec">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hdev-sec-header">
        <span class="hdev-sec-eyebrow">Outcome Capabilities</span>
        <h2>What Can Our Dedicated Odoo Developers Build?</h2>
        <p>From custom Python module development to API connectors and high-availability database optimization.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hdev-caps-grid">
        <div class="hdev-cap">
          <div class="hdev-cap-header">
            <div class="hdev-cap-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
