          </div>
          <p>Extend standard Odoo apps (CRM, Sales, MRP, Accounting, HR) with custom views, fields, dynamic filters, and permission rules.</p>
          <div class="hdev-cap-outcome">🎯 <strong>Business Outcome:</strong> Adapts Odoo to match your exact team preferences.</div>
