              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>OWL Dashboards &amp; QWeb Reports</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Design modern interactive executive BI dashboards using OWL and pixel-perfect QWeb PDF invoices, purchase orders, and financial statements.</p>
          <div class="hdev-cap-outcome">🎯 <strong>Business Outcome:</strong> Real-time operational visibility and professional customer documents.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="hdev-cap">
          <div class="hdev-cap-header">
            <div class="hdev-cap-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="1" y="4" width="22" height="16" rx="2"/><line x1="1" y1="10" x2="23" y2="10"/></svg>
