          <div class="hdev-cap-outcome">🎯 <strong>Business Outcome:</strong> Instant payment processing and automated ledger reconciliation.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="hdev-cap">
          <div class="hdev-cap-header">
            <div class="hdev-cap-icon">
