          <div class="hdev-cap-outcome">🎯 <strong>Business Outcome:</strong> Single source of truth across all external software tools.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="hdev-cap">
          <div class="hdev-cap-header">
            <div class="hdev-cap-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10"/><path d="M20.49 15a9 9 0 1 1-2.12-9.36L23 10"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Migrate Between Odoo Versions</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Upgrade older Odoo databases (v13/14/15/16) to Odoo 17/18 with full custom code refactoring, staging trial runs, and zero data loss.</p>
          <div class="hdev-cap-outcome">🎯 <strong>Business Outcome:</strong> Unlock latest Odoo features without risking system downtime.</div>
        </div>

