        </div>

        <div class="hdev-cap">
          <div class="hdev-cap-header">
            <div class="hdev-cap-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Maintain &amp; Upgrade ERP Systems</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Continuous 24/7 technical support, automated cloud backups, security patch deployments, user permission reviews, and hypercare support.</p>
          <div class="hdev-cap-outcome">🎯 <strong>Business Outcome:</strong> Peace of mind with guaranteed 99.9% uptime SLAs.</div>
