          <p>Perfect for enterprise ERP implementations, multi-company setups, high-concurrency database tuning, and strategic advisory.</p>
          
          <div class="hdev-tier-skills">
            <strong>Core Skillset:</strong>
            <ul>
              <li>• Enterprise ERP Architecture Planning</li>
              <li>• Multi-Company &amp; Multi-Currency Systems</li>
              <li>• High-Concurrency PostgreSQL Indexing</li>
              <li>• Complex Data Migration &amp; Upgrade Runs</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <button class="hdev-btn hdev-btn-secondary hdev-btn-full js-open-hire-modal" data-level="Senior Odoo Developer">
            Hire Senior Architect
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════
       6. FLEXIBLE ENGAGEMENT MODELS
  ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
